==== Base joint validation
The two prismatic base joints use PD control ($K = 8000$, $D = 800$) with gravitational feedforward for the $Z$ axis. @tab:base_metrics summarizes the results: settling times are below 200~ms and steady-state errors are negligible (${<} 0.003 "mm"$).

